d:"Delivered! The next drone is on its way…",statusStunned:"Stunned!",waypointDrop:"Drop",waypointCargo:"Parcel",waypointDelivery:"Deliver here",toastDelivered:"DELIVERED! +{points}",toastPickedUp:"You got the parcel!",toastDropped:"Parcel dropped!",toastReset:"The parcel is back on the map",toastHitRival:"Nice hit!",toastStolen:"Parcel knocked loose!",toastGotHit:"{name} hit you!",toastPoliceYou:"The patrol saw it! Fined: parcel confiscated",toastPoliceRival:"Patrol fined {name}",toastBlocked:"Shield blocked the hit!",toastBitten:"A dog bit you!",wxMorning:"Morning",wxDay:"Day",wxEvening:"Evening",wxNight:"Night",wxClear:"clear",wxShowers:"passing showers",wxRain:"rain",wxStorm:"thunderstorm",wxFog:"fog",wxDust:"dust storm",wxLightSnow:"light snow",wxSnow:"snowfall",meteorShower:"Meteor shower! Get off the red marks!",cannonVolley:"The fort's cannons are firing barrels! Get off the red marks!",cannonHitToast:"Barrel! The parcel flew off",centipedeToast:"The centipede dragged you underground!",centipedeWarn:"The ground is shaking — run!",lostOpened:"Parcel scanned… island coordinates received! «Lost World» is open!",lostAlready:"The terminal blinks: «The island is waiting for you»",trexChaseToast:"A T-rex is after you — run for your life!",raptorHuntToast:"Raptors are circling — keep moving!",trikeWarnToast:"The triceratops lowers its horns!",dinoHitToast:"A dinosaur knocked you down!",dinoHitParcelToast:"A dinosaur knocked the parcel away!",pteroSwoopToast:"A pteranodon dives for the parcel!",pteroStoleToast:"A pteranodon carried the parcel off!",pteroScaredToast:"Pteranodon scared off!",splashToast:"Splash! You were fished out of the water",parrotScaredToast:"The parrot flew off empty-clawed!",parrotParcelToast:"The parrot knocked your parcel loose!",parrotStoleToast:"The parrot stole: {item}",parrotSwoopToast:"The thief parrot is coming for you — punch it!",waveHitToast:"A wave knocked you down!",bridgeUpToast:"The bridge is opening — find another way!",baySquall